{
 "name": "AdvancedEffect_Depth_CM_ForDragon_Outline_Second",
 "entry": "WuwaDepthFX_DragonSecond",
 "include": "/Plugin/WuwaToon/Private/WuwaToonBasePass_DepthFX.ush",
 "kuro_shading_model": "MSM_ToonCommon in the root material, but the base pass is forward unlit (no lighting, no GBuffer)",
 "kuro_asm": "M_AdvancedEffect_Depth_CM_ForDragon_Outline PS 689667b14e (#310093) / VS 306aa3ba (#310091); Second + Dissolve + Mask + BumpNoise (outline shell)",
 "kuro_root_material": "M_AdvancedEffect_Depth_CM_ForDragon_Outline",
 "blend_mode": "BLEND_Translucent",
 "two_sided": false,
 "resolve": false,
 "resolve_note": "\"Depth\" is a DEPTH DITHER of the opacity, not a scene-depth read (no SceneDepth / SceneTexture in the PS): threshold = UE DitherTemporalAA ((uint(Pix.x + TAA.x) + 2 uint(Pix.y + TAA.x)) % 5 + noise(Pix/64).r) / 6 against op * lerp(DepthDitherFactorNight, DepthDitherFactorDay, lerp(MPC GlobalDayNightFactor, 1, UseWholeDayDither >= 0.2)); soft form: Opacity = saturate(op * (op * f + dither - 0.5)). forward translucent unlit: Emissive + Opacity to a UE translucent unlit material. Kuro engine tail (not ported, UE applies its own): opacity *= Kuro primitive fade (Primitive[43]); colour = max(E, 0) (*View[285] unless Primitive[42].w), OOB stripes, vertex fog (TEXCOORD7 inscatter + transmittance) / volumetric fog; o0 = (max(rgb * fogT + fogI, 0), opacity), single target (no o1, no Kuro effect grading).",
 "vs_note": "VS 306aa3ba10 (#310091): inverted-hull outline extrusion; material reads only OutlineClipWidth / OutlineHoldDistance / InnerOutlineOffset = the character-outline WPO family A_NoVG. Verified bit-exact on SV_POSITION against WuwaToonOutlineWPO_A_NoVG (tools/shaderdiff/weapons/r3/depthfx_vs_wpo.py, evidence/validation/shaderdiff/weapons/round3/depthfx/results_vs_wpo_depthfx_final.json).",
 "outputs": {
  "Emissive": {
   "type": "float3",
   "kuro": "material Emissive Color (before the engine translucent tail: fog, OOB, Kuro effect grading)"
  },
  "Opacity": {
   "type": "float",
   "kuro": "material Opacity (o0.a = o1.a after the tail)"
  }
 },
